        "heading_B8aHtW": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Are the Key Benefits & Latest Trends of Food and Beverage Labels?",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_NVnkEw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Product labels can make a difference in consumers’ buying decisions, so it’s important to carefully consider the look and feel of your labels. In the food and beverage sector, labels must also display a wealth of important safety and ingredient information per industry regulations. But how can you best grab consumers’ attention on store shelves to beat out product competition? This blog will discuss some current industry trends, and how incorporating them into customized labels can encourage customers to choose your brand.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_B8aHtW",
        "text_NVnkEw"
      ],
