    "image_with_text_hJwYNn": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_8RMFYm": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Are the Benefits of Using NADCO’s Custom Labels for Food & Beverages?",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_6hPwqP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At NADCO® Tapes & Labels, Inc., we continue to invest in research and innovative technologies to improve the consumer experience with our brand and keep up with emerging trends and market demands. Our <a href=\"/pages/graphic-design-label-prototyping\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Graphic Design & Label Prototyping\">full-service graphics department</a> will work with you to create a label design that best showcases your product and company. These designs can include FDA-compliant nutritional panels, UPC and other categories of barcode generation, and comprehensive SKU alterations, all while keeping to your brand’s look and feel. </p><p>As part of the NADCO difference, our team offers:</p><ul><li><strong>Consistent quality and service.</strong> By offering <a href=\"/pages/our-roll-in-your-world\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Our Roll in Your World\">our services in-house</a>, you are guaranteed the same quality every time, with no chance of your specifications being overlooked by outside vendors.</li><li><strong>Superior custom capabilities. </strong>To best serve you, we offer our comprehensive capabilities include <a href=\"/pages/graphic-design-label-prototyping\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Graphic Design & Label Prototyping\">graphic designing and prototyping</a>, <a href=\"/pages/digital-printing-solutions\" title=\"Digital Printing Solutions\">digital printing and die cutting</a>, and more. Our team will work with you to create a custom solution for your unique application.</li><li><strong>Reduced lead times.</strong> We utilize a full-service manufacturing line to eliminate part wait times, support production efficiency, and boost our accountability.</li></ul><h2>Partner With NADCO</h2><p>Keeping up with the latest trends in food and beverage labels can help you stay ahead of your competition and attract more customers for your brand. At NADCO, we have the customization capabilities and high-quality, pressure-sensitive labels to support your operations. Our team can collaborate directly with packaging, bottling, and canning companies in printing your custom labels, tapes, and packaging films. This is important to ensure that all auto-labeling spec considerations are made and adhered to; with NADCO, you cut out the middleman by letting us handle these details.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact us\">Contact us</a> today to <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> and learn about other services we have to offer the food and beverage industry.</p>",
            "subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_8RMFYm",
        "text_6hPwqP"
      ],
